### Niches. Needs a signed-in user.
### Get a token by signing in (see auth.http) and paste its accessToken here:
@token = <paste accessToken>
@nicheId = <paste a niche id>

### G4 reach -> { postsToday, freshWindow }. Cached 60 s per niche.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/niches/{{nicheId}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 404 NICHE_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/niches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 400 BAD_REQUEST: not a UUID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/niches/football/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 401 without a token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/niches/{{nicheId}}/stats
